    <entry key="customDescription" type="xstring" value="Calculates additional 'Delivery Relations'-data based on information (station, product, lotnumber) that is provided e.g. by the 'Supply Chain Reader'. Expected input ports are: 1. 'Deliveries'-data, 2. 'Delivery Relations'-data. In the output port the enriched 'Delivery Relations'-data is given."/>
